{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A small game about boss fights</h2><br>Mini-Dead is a short but intense boss fighting game, using a simple but incredibly effective game mechanic that runs at <strong>144 fps</strong> which is perfect for those who want to put their 144hz monitors to good use!<br><br>Three bosses stand in your way along with a fourth, secret fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple but effect game mechanic</h2><br>The controls are simple.<br><br>You move with the mouse to dodge attacks.<br>Click and drag to create a piercing beam that damages enemies.<br>Release left mouse button to teleport to the end of the beam.<br><br>What better way to fight bosses than to use your mouse! The ultimate hardware for reflex based game play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why &quot;Mini-Dead?&quot;</h2><br>Boss fights are cool. The feeling of overcoming a boss is pure bliss. <i>Mini-Dead</i> is a compressed, little brother of meatier game <i>Dead</i>.<br><br>Check out DEAD on Steam: ","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"929010ef57c9be20b8f3b5bae40b1d4e68b9e3ef.jpg","localized_name":"Fetus Dead","name":"Fetus Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/851530/929010ef57c9be20b8f3b5bae40b1d4e68b9e3ef.jpg"},{"icon":"94c6574a183609e4584c4a1935e0778e04a15980.jpg","localized_name":"Iris Dead","name":"Iris Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/851530/94c6574a183609e4584c4a1935e0778e04a15980.jpg"},{"icon":"0d1b0a279a6ff4b3b057fb5bb25775125d04ad22.jpg","localized_name":"Beserker Dead","name":"Beserker Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/851530/0d1b0a279a6ff4b3b057fb5bb25775125d04ad22.jpg"},{"icon":"fc8e02ee8513f6e45892e722fbee5977007fd599.jpg","localized_name":"What Have You Done","name":"What Have You Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/851530/fc8e02ee8513f6e45892e722fbee5977007fd599.jpg"},{"icon":"6e20